\"strong\">Imagine you visited a country and returned with a number of items. One of the items turns out to be very valuable.</span><br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Instructions:<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Write a 10 line dialogue between you and a friend.</span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Describe the item and what you learned about it.</span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Include the location of the item. Living room? Bedroom?</span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use the Past Continuous tense and the Past tense in a sentence.</span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Show surprise and disbelief.</span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button. </span></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">My Dialogue</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Remember to:<br><ol><li>Describe the location of the item. </li> <li>Show surprise and disbelief. </li> <li>Explain what happened. </li> <li>Use the Past Continuous tense and the Past tense in a sentence.</li> <li>Write in complete sentences.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your dialogue for spelling, grammar and punctuation errors.  <br><br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Click the <span class=\"strong\">Submit </span> button to save your work.", "type": "text"