 of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<br><br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or actions that were happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular. <br>Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.<br> Irregular verbs change in different ways. <br>For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did </span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask \u2026 ?</span><br><span class=\"italic\">Did </span>is  the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For Past Continuous, you add <span class=\"italic\">was/were</span> + verb \u201cing\u201d to verbs. <br> Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cing\u201d</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walk \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walked  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were walking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focus \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focused \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were focusing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lead\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"led\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   was/were leading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"return \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"returned \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were returning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swerve \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swerved \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were swerving\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Reacting to a Story - Expressing Shock and Disbelief", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Shock is a sudden, usually unpleasant feeling.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are shocked, you are in disbelief.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was shocked to read the story. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was stunned by the news.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">She was completely taken aback by his response to her question. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was stunned by the price of the car she bought.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">The outcome came as a complete surprise. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">They are all in complete shock.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br><br>Disbelief is a feeling that you do not or cannot believe or accept that something is true or real.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I just can't believe he married my sister. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">It's unbelievable that they finished the test on time.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"> I can't imagine they weren't able to get to work on time.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a blog about rooms and objects.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coincidence ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a situation in which events that are not planned or expected happen at the same time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was a coincidence that she had the same painting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ensuite ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to describe a bathroom that is directly connected to a bedroom ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hung one of the paintings in the ensuite.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hallway", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the area between two rooms where you walk ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My miniature Greek statue is in the hallway.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "appraiser ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who gives an opinion on the value of an object ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My mother's friend is an appraiser.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tupperware", "type": "name"}, {"content": "plastic containers used for storage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My mother's friend dropped off some tupperware.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "collectable ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "good for a collection", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Those statues are very collectable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "auction house ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place where you buy and sell items through bidding", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My mother's friend works at an auction house.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research knick-knacks.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of ten knick-knacks you can buy. How much do they cost?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose three knick-knacks you like the most.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write three sentences about these knick-knacks. Are they cheap? Expensive?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your notes aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research knick-knacks online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a list of items I find online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my list to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}